{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14064","headline":"送大谷高少府 · 耿湋","name":"送大谷高少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"县属幷州北近胡，悠悠此别宦仍孤。\n应知史笔思循吏，莫料辕门笑鲁儒。\n古塞草青宜牧马，春城月暗好啼乌。\n雕残贵有亲仁术，梅福何须去隐吴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}